				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13405506/my-lonely-child#post-4683344</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 10 Jun 2020 10:03:21 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Mortal Glare</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>6082834</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>+1 because I do like what was written, or rather what was written was written well. While I very much like the idea of the Tale i think personally for me the creature was a little too human, perhaps that was the intention. But the use of very human swear words felt a little much for my own perception of it.</p> <p>The only other thing i'd say is that the &quot;there are no monsters here, oh wait, i'm the monster&quot; bit was just a touch heavy handed, though maybe thats just an over exposure to the trope. As overall I still enjoyed reading it.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
